WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The tablet's WiFi list. Tap on eduroam-lab.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Username and password: pablo@uni-wipkingen.ch.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Android asks for a CA certificate. With no profile installed, "Trust on first use" is the obvious choice.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Connect.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.500
The impostor's certificate: issuer "Rogue CA". One tap on Trust.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:25.000
The connection fails, but the password has already gone to the impostor.
